{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-engines","title":"存储引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/storage-engines","wordCount":802,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"存储引擎\">存储引擎</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>存储引擎是数据库管理系统中负责数据存储、检索和管理的核心组件。不同的存储引擎在数据组织方式、事务支持、并发控制和性能特性上有显著差异，选择合适的引擎直接影响系统的整体表现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SQL[SQL 层] --&gt; SE[存储引擎接口]&#10;    SE --&gt; InnoDB&#10;    SE --&gt; MyISAM&#10;    SE --&gt; RocksDB&#10;    SE --&gt; Memory\">graph TD\n    SQL[SQL 层] --&gt; SE[存储引擎接口]\n    SE --&gt; InnoDB\n    SE --&gt; MyISAM\n    SE --&gt; RocksDB\n    SE --&gt; Memory</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"innodb-vs-myisam\">InnoDB vs MyISAM</h2><p>MySQL 中最重要的两个存储引擎对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>InnoDB</th>\n<th>MyISAM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事务支持</td>\n<td>✅ 完整 ACID</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁粒度</td>\n<td>行级锁</td>\n<td>表级锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外键约束</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩溃恢复</td>\n<td>✅ 基于 redo log</td>\n<td>❌ 需手动修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚簇索引</td>\n<td>✅ 主键即数据</td>\n<td>❌ 堆表，索引指向行地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全文索引</td>\n<td>✅（MySQL 5.6+）</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td>✅ 页级压缩</td>\n<td>✅ 表级压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MVCC</td>\n<td>✅ 多版本并发控制</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>OLTP、事务密集</td>\n<td>只读分析、全文检索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查看当前表使用的存储引擎&#10;SHOW TABLE STATUS LIKE &#39;orders&#39;\\G&#10;&#10;-- 创建表时指定引擎&#10;CREATE TABLE logs (&#10;    id BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    message TEXT,&#10;    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;&#10;&#10;-- 修改已有表的引擎&#10;ALTER TABLE legacy_table ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看当前表使用的存储引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\\G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建表时指定引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 修改已有表的引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legacy_table ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"innodb-架构\">InnoDB 架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 内存&#10;        BP[Buffer Pool 缓冲池]&#10;        LB[Log Buffer 日志缓冲]&#10;        AHI[Adaptive Hash Index]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 磁盘&#10;        TS[表空间文件 .ibd]&#10;        RL[Redo Log]&#10;        UL[Undo Log]&#10;        DW[Doublewrite Buffer]&#10;    end&#10;    BP --&gt; TS&#10;    LB --&gt; RL&#10;    BP --&gt; DW --&gt; TS\">graph TD\n    subgraph 内存\n        BP[Buffer Pool 缓冲池]\n        LB[Log Buffer 日志缓冲]\n        AHI[Adaptive Hash Index]\n    end\n    subgraph 磁盘\n        TS[表空间文件 .ibd]\n        RL[Redo Log]\n        UL[Undo Log]\n        DW[Doublewrite Buffer]\n    end\n    BP --&gt; TS\n    LB --&gt; RL\n    BP --&gt; DW --&gt; TS</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lsm-tree\">LSM-Tree</h2><p>LSM-Tree（Log-Structured Merge-Tree）是一种针对<strong>写入优化</strong>的数据结构，被 RocksDB、LevelDB、Cassandra、HBase 等广泛采用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    W[写入] --&gt; MT[MemTable 内存]&#10;    MT --&gt;|写满| IMM[Immutable MemTable]&#10;    IMM --&gt;|Flush| L0[Level 0 SSTable]&#10;    L0 --&gt;|Compaction| L1[Level 1]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|Compaction| L2[Level 2]\">graph TD\n    W[写入] --&gt; MT[MemTable 内存]\n    MT --&gt;|写满| IMM[Immutable MemTable]\n    IMM --&gt;|Flush| L0[Level 0 SSTable]\n    L0 --&gt;|Compaction| L1[Level 1]\n    L1 --&gt;|Compaction| L2[Level 2]</pre><h3 id=\"lsm-tree-工作原理\">LSM-Tree 工作原理</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>写入</strong>：数据先写入内存中的 MemTable（通常是跳表或红黑树）</li>\n<li><strong>刷盘</strong>：MemTable 写满后转为 Immutable MemTable，刷写到磁盘的 SSTable</li>\n<li><strong>合并</strong>：后台 Compaction 线程将多个 SSTable 合并，消除重复和删除标记</li>\n<li><strong>读取</strong>：先查 MemTable → 再查各层 SSTable（Bloom Filter 加速）</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>B+ 树</th>\n<th>LSM-Tree</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>写入性能</td>\n<td>中等（随机写）</td>\n<td>高（顺序写）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读取性能</td>\n<td>高（一次定位）</td>\n<td>中等（多层查找）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间放大</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等（多版本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写放大</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（Compaction）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>读多写少 OLTP</td>\n<td>写多读少、日志</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wal-write-ahead-logging\">WAL（Write-Ahead Logging）</h2><p>WAL 是数据库保证持久性和崩溃恢复的核心机制：先写日志，后写数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client&#10;    participant DB as 数据库&#10;    participant WAL as WAL 日志&#10;    participant Disk as 数据文件&#10;&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE ...&#10;    DB-&gt;&gt;WAL: 写入 redo log(顺序写)&#10;    WAL--&gt;&gt;DB: 确认&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;Client: 事务提交成功&#10;    Note over DB,Disk: 后台异步刷脏页&#10;    DB-&gt;&gt;Disk: 写入数据页(随机写)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant DB as 数据库\n    participant WAL as WAL 日志\n    participant Disk as 数据文件\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE ...\n    DB-&gt;&gt;WAL: 写入 redo log(顺序写)\n    WAL--&gt;&gt;DB: 确认\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Client: 事务提交成功\n    Note over DB,Disk: 后台异步刷脏页\n    DB-&gt;&gt;Disk: 写入数据页(随机写)</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WAL 组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>InnoDB 对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Redo Log</td>\n<td>记录物理修改，用于崩溃恢复</td>\n<td>ib_logfile0/1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Undo Log</td>\n<td>记录逻辑修改，用于回滚和 MVCC</td>\n<td>undo tablespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Checkpoint</td>\n<td>标记已刷盘位置，缩短恢复时间</td>\n<td>LSN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL：查看 InnoDB redo log 配置&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE &#39;innodb_log_file_size&#39;;&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE &#39;innodb_log_files_in_group&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL：查看 WAL 配置&#10;SHOW wal_level;&#10;SHOW max_wal_size;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：查看 InnoDB redo log 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW VARIABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'innodb_log_file_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW VARIABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'innodb_log_files_in_group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：查看 WAL 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW wal_level;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW max_wal_size;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"页面管理\">页面管理</h2><p>数据库以**页（Page）**为最小 I/O 单位管理数据，通常为 8KB（PostgreSQL）或 16KB（InnoDB）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据页</td>\n<td>存储表数据的基本单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引页</td>\n<td>存储 B+ 树索引节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页分裂</td>\n<td>页满时分裂为两个页，影响插入性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页合并</td>\n<td>页利用率过低时合并，减少空间浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充因子</td>\n<td>预留空间比例，减少页分裂频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：设置填充因子&#10;CREATE TABLE hot_data (&#10;    id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    value TEXT&#10;) WITH (fillfactor = 80);&#10;&#10;-- MySQL：查看 InnoDB 页大小&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE &#39;innodb_page_size&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：设置填充因子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hot_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fillfactor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：查看 InnoDB 页大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW VARIABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'innodb_page_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲池-buffer-pool\">缓冲池（Buffer Pool）</h2><p>缓冲池是数据库最重要的内存组件，缓存频繁访问的数据页，减少磁盘 I/O。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Q[查询请求] --&gt; BP{缓冲池}&#10;    BP --&gt;|命中| R[直接返回]&#10;    BP --&gt;|未命中| D[磁盘读取]&#10;    D --&gt; BP&#10;    BP --&gt; R\">graph LR\n    Q[查询请求] --&gt; BP{缓冲池}\n    BP --&gt;|命中| R[直接返回]\n    BP --&gt;|未命中| D[磁盘读取]\n    D --&gt; BP\n    BP --&gt; R</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>innodb_buffer_pool_size</td>\n<td>缓冲池总大小</td>\n<td>物理内存的 70-80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>innodb_buffer_pool_instances</td>\n<td>缓冲池实例数</td>\n<td>CPU 核心数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>effective_cache_size</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 缓存估算</td>\n<td>物理内存的 50-75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>shared_buffers</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 共享缓冲区</td>\n<td>物理内存的 25%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL：查看缓冲池状态&#10;SHOW STATUS LIKE &#39;Innodb_buffer_pool%&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 关键指标&#10;-- Innodb_buffer_pool_read_requests  缓冲池读请求数&#10;-- Innodb_buffer_pool_reads          需要从磁盘读取的次数&#10;-- 命中率 = 1 - reads / read_requests（应 &gt; 99%）&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL：查看缓冲区命中率&#10;SELECT&#10;    sum(heap_blks_hit) / (sum(heap_blks_hit) + sum(heap_blks_read)) AS hit_ratio&#10;FROM pg_statio_user_tables;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：查看缓冲池状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Innodb_buffer_pool%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关键指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Innodb_buffer_pool_read_requests  缓冲池读请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Innodb_buffer_pool_reads          需要从磁盘读取的次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 命中率 = 1 - reads / read_requests（应 > 99%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：查看缓冲区命中率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(heap_blks_hit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(heap_blks_hit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(heap_blks_read)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hit_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_statio_user_tables;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((存储引擎))&#10;    InnoDB&#10;      行级锁&#10;      MVCC&#10;      聚簇索引&#10;      崩溃恢复&#10;    LSM-Tree&#10;      写入优化&#10;      顺序写&#10;      Compaction&#10;    WAL&#10;      先写日志后写数据&#10;      Redo / Undo&#10;      Checkpoint&#10;    页面管理&#10;      页分裂 / 合并&#10;      填充因子&#10;    缓冲池&#10;      缓存数据页&#10;      命中率 &gt; 99%\">mindmap\n  root((存储引擎))\n    InnoDB\n      行级锁\n      MVCC\n      聚簇索引\n      崩溃恢复\n    LSM-Tree\n      写入优化\n      顺序写\n      Compaction\n    WAL\n      先写日志后写数据\n      Redo / Undo\n      Checkpoint\n    页面管理\n      页分裂 / 合并\n      填充因子\n    缓冲池\n      缓存数据页\n      命中率 &gt; 99%</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>InnoDB</strong> 是 MySQL 的默认引擎，支持事务、行级锁和 MVCC，适合 OLTP 场景。</li>\n<li><strong>LSM-Tree</strong> 通过顺序写优化写入性能，适合日志、时序等写密集场景。</li>\n<li><strong>WAL</strong> 机制（先写日志后写数据）是数据库保证持久性和崩溃恢复的基石。</li>\n<li><strong>缓冲池</strong>命中率应保持在 99% 以上，是性能调优的关键指标。</li>\n<li>存储引擎的选择应根据<strong>读写比例、事务需求和数据规模</strong>综合决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存储引擎","id":"存储引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"InnoDB vs MyISAM","id":"innodb-vs-myisam"},{"level":3,"text":"InnoDB 架构","id":"innodb-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"LSM-Tree","id":"lsm-tree"},{"level":3,"text":"LSM-Tree 工作原理","id":"lsm-tree-工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"WAL（Write-Ahead Logging）","id":"wal-write-ahead-logging"},{"level":2,"text":"页面管理","id":"页面管理"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲池（Buffer Pool）","id":"缓冲池-buffer-pool"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"哈希与位图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/hash-and-bitmap"},"next":{"title":"分区与分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/partitioning"}}